  "translation": "Yenna: d acu-t weɛrabun ara d-mudduɣ? Tenna: aḥettem-ik, d azrar-ik, d taɛṣa-ik yellan deg ufus-ik. Imudda-tt, yekcem ɣur-s, teqebbeḍ fell-as.",
